From 15fd992f0110c269430d7efb767c29a2ca6c9a9e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hui <vlado.kerando@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:02:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/43] Mod API: block entities for server mods (capability
 block-entities)

A server mod claims blocks; each placed copy keeps bytes of the mod's own,
ticked in loaded chunks, removed with its block and saved with the world in
data/horizon/block_entities.json. Example mod: cells (lodestone energy cells).

Horizon-Forge-Api: block-entities-1
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
