Subject: [PATCH 02/43] Mod API: shared energy buffers on block entities
 (capability energy)

A server mod gives its block entities energy buffers; any mod reads, fills
and drains any buffer within its limits, and push shares a buffer's energy
with its six sides. Buffers go with their block entity after `removed` and
are saved in data/horizon/energy.json. The cells example now keeps its
charge in buffers, moving a first version's data over.

