From fe5e71f92bf24ffe4e531b7302fa5c4e2650f50b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hui <vlado.kerando@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:18:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/43] Mod API: chest menus for server mods (capability menus)

A server mod opens vanilla chest menus (1 to 6 rows) for a player with
items of its own; clicks on the menu's slots reach `menu-events.clicked`,
and the menu shows the mod's items again after each, so nothing is taken.
set-items refreshes it, close closes it, `closed` follows the player. Test
scripts gain a `click` step; the cells example gets /cellgui, a live charge
display with drain and fill buttons.

