From: hui <vlado.kerando@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:26:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 04/43] Mod API: server mods take the use of their blocks
 (block-use-events)

A server mod with block entities names the claimed blocks whose right
click it takes; such a click reaches `used` with the block's data at the
tick's end and does nothing else in the game, while a sneaking player with
an item still places or uses it as vanilla does. A block entity missing
under a used block is made then. Test scripts gain a `use` step; a right
click on a cells lodestone opens its menu.

