From 4712955a8731a5afa88ac98af0bd58d5d0048cd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hui <vlado.kerando@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:44:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/43] Mod API: display entities for server mods (capability
 displays)

A server mod shows block models and floating text in the world by name,
with a transform the client blends to over a number of ticks. The game
sends them as vanilla block_display and text_display entities to the
players in their dimension (and to those who arrive later), changes only
their data when just the transform or text changes, and drops them with
their mod. Horizon's client now draws block displays through the same
display matrix and interpolation as text displays. The cells example shows
each cell's charge above it, with a spinning redstone core.

